    {
      "detail": "One past the packing radius the nearest codeword stops being unique.  The decoder reports `ambiguous` and returns all six rather than picking one, so the boundary is visible to the caller instead of being hidden by a silent tie-break.",
      "key": "weight_4_is_ambiguous",
      "statement": "10626 of 10626 weight-4 patterns are equidistant from six codewords."
